  "spell.asterismarcanum.arcanum_brightburst": "明耀爆发",
  "spell.asterismarcanum.arcanum_brightburst.guide": "以低伤害的光爆击退周围敌人。",
  "spell.asterismarcanum.arcanum_star_swarm": "群星之潮",
  "spell.asterismarcanum.arcanum_star_swarm.guide": "引导五处星门，持续向准星方向发射光针；停止引导后星门消散。",
  "spell.asterismarcanum.arcanum_luminous_beam": "辉光射线",
